 like you then  maybe the m2 macbook pro was made for  you you just get the straight bezel no  notch at all now getting into the second  advantage the fact is the m2 macbook pro  does have a fan now this does mean that  you are going to be getting better  performance for extended workloads maybe  even workloads that last 5 10 15 minutes  not even hours because in our testing we  showed that in our most extreme thermal  throttling test even this m2 macbook pro  managed to throttle and clock down the  speed of the chip all the way from  around 29.5 watts down to seven because  the fan even with the fan it wasn't able  to keep it cool it was maxing out at 7  200 rpms now that was an extreme test  but in other ones like cinebench or  lightroom photo exports we actually got  the fan to ramp up to almost 4 or even 5  000 rpms in some cases which means that  without a fan with the m2 macbook air  you're likely going to see more  throttling than this model so if you're  doing a lot of extended workloads maybe  that fan is going to be a better choice  for you and now moving on to the third  advantage the m2 macbook pro has over  the air this one actually comes with the  10 core gpu as standard so anybody going  into the apple store best buy anywhere  else and buying the base model which is  basically the only one available you're  going to be getting the faster 10 core  gpu now that is going to be great for  different things like gaming getting  more fps getting of course sustained  gaming fps with the fan installed so  that is another advantage that it comes  base with the 10 core gpu now getting  into the fourth advantage you have  better battery life of course this m2  macbook pro comes with a larger battery  than the m2 macbook air and in terms of  what apple rates the battery life to be  like it gives you two extra hours of  battery life however the m2 chip  actually comes packed with newer and  faster efficiency cores which means that  they can handle more tasks by themselves  without having to fire up the  performance cores which actually leads  to some pretty impressive battery life  on this m2 macbook pro even compared to  the previous m1 macbook pro so because  it has a larger battery it is going to  be giving you the best battery life out  of any new apple silicon macbook out  there even better than the 14 and 16  inch models and now getting into the  fifth advantage the empty macbook pro  has over the new macbook air this one of  course comes with the touch bar now i  personally don't like it but there are  some people who love the touch bar they  love using it they love customizing it  there's also the better touch tool which  allows you to really get into the fine  tuning and customization of the touch  bar that is an advantage because the  macbook air does not get the touch bar  it just has the standard function keys  which you cannot customize them so to  some people this is the last touch bar  equipped macbook pro and some are  actually going to be buying this for  that reason so if you enjoy that touch  part or you like the idea of having a  digital display on your keyboard then  this is going to be an advantage for you  with the macbook pro now for the sixth  advantage this m2 macbook pro comes  standard with the higher end 67 watt  power adapter now you might not know  this but the base m2 macbook air  actually comes with a 30 watt adapter  which is less than half the wattage or  speed of charging compared to this m2  macbook pro so it's going to be charging  slower than this one is which is very  interesting now if you want the same  charger you actually have to pay an  extra 20  on the macbook air to get the 67 watt  adapter just like this one gets so this  one definitely has the advantage of  having that built in when you buy it  standard and finally for the seventh  advantage the macbook pro has over the  air this one actually has studio quality  microphones which the m2 macbook air is  not advertised to get so 